  "summary": "The Xinhai (1911) Revolution began with the Wuchang revolt on 10 October 1911 and brought down the Qing dynasty, ending 268 years of Manchu rule. Provinces declared for the revolutionaries, a republic was proclaimed with Sun Yat-sen as provisional president, and the Xuantong emperor abdicated on 12 February 1912.",
